{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y在S10—S12等短停留段放入了过多完整的大字句，观众扫屏时不如X轻松，缺少快速抓取信息的余地。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y最大的优势是把人物的动机、情绪转折和行动理由放进了大字，不依赖小字也能明白他为什么怀念、为什么犹豫、最后为什么决定继续生活，前后也形成了完整的心理过程。它没有丢掉原有词组中的感官细节，还增加了诸如短暂高兴后转为心酸、刚有暖意又重新感到孤单等细微过渡。代价是X那种短句带来的呼吸感和扫屏效率有所下降，尤其S10—S12，Y有些解释得太满。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "7f4ba8d1-cf9f-4923-a0a9-6892a24d0b61", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261105T185933778204Z", "elapsed_seconds": 106.875, "completed_utc": "2026-11-05T19:01:20.669847+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "eabea945150de9f70da89804d484fc198eb81dbfa2ef4985c2eb3d9448f64c0c", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments